{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13724","headline":"在滁苦雨归桃花崦伤亲友略尽 · 顾况","name":"在滁苦雨归桃花崦伤亲友略尽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"废弃忝残生，後来亦先夭。\n诗人感风雨，长夜何时晓。\n去国宦情无，近乡归梦少。\n庇身绝中授，甘静忘外扰。\n丽景变重阴，洞山空木表。\n灵潮若可通，寄谢西飞鸟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13724.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13724","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}